Bool: size 1, align 1, stride 1, tag word at 0, payload at 0, scalar of 1 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above

Ordering: size 1, align 1, stride 1, tag word at 0, payload at 0, scalar of 2 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..2, free 0 below / 253 above

Sum: size 8, align 4, stride 8, tag word at 0, payload at 4, niche absent

Colour: size 8, align 4, stride 8, tag word at 0, payload at 4, niche absent

Five: size 8, align 4, stride 8, tag word at 0, payload at 4, niche absent

Flags: size 1, align 1, stride 1, scalar of 2 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..3, free 0 below / 252 above
  .0 at 0 bits 0..0 of 1 bytes: Bool
  .1 at 0 bits 1..1 of 1 bytes: Bool

Tagged: size 8, align 4, stride 8, tag word at 0, payload at 4, niche absent

Wide: size 8, align 4, stride 8, tag word at 0, payload at 4, niche absent

Maybe(Sum): size 8, align 4, stride 8, tag folded into constructor 1's absence, niche none
